  "highlight": "Nathan Payas crossed the English Channel from England to France in 9 hours 13 minutes on 11 September 2016.",
  "biography": [
    "Payas crossed the English Channel in 9 hours 13 minutes, with Eddie Spelling piloting Mighty Mo and John Payas listed as trainer. His 2018 Manhattan finish completed the international Triple Crown. The Gibraltar Chronicle identified him as the first Gibraltarian to complete it.",
